          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Running an older version" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "يعمل بإصدار أقدم"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Running, and not sending Caps Lock to %@ yet" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "يعمل، ولا يرسل Caps Lock إلى %@ بعد"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Running, and sending Caps Lock to %@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "يعمل، ويرسل Caps Lock إلى %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Set Up" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ابدأ الإعداد"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Set Up prepares this Mac and Windows, so you can hold Caps Lock as your screen reader's key." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "زر «ابدأ الإعداد» يجهّز الماك وويندوز معًا، لتستخدم Caps Lock بالضغط المستمر مفتاحًا لقارئ الشاشة."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Set up, and ready the next time Windows starts" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "جُهِّز، وسيعمل عند تشغيل ويندوز القادم"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Set up, and waiting for Windows to restart" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "جُهِّز، وينتظر إعادة تشغيل ويندوز"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Set up. It can't be checked right now" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "جُهِّز. يتعذّر فحصه الآن"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Set up. It's checked again when Windows runs" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "جُهِّز. يُفحص مجددًا حين يعمل ويندوز"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Setting up the Caps Lock key in Windows…" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "جارٍ تجهيز مفتاح Caps Lock في ويندوز…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Something needs fixing" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
